 ## A current investment plan needs a response record
 
-[USTR's February 2026 fact sheet](https://ustr.gov/about/policy-offices/press-office/fact-sheets/2026/february/fact-sheet-us-taiwan-agreement-reciprocal-trade) describes the two sides' intention to facilitate cross-border investment and possible US support for private investment financing in Taiwan, subject to applicable law. That policy context makes transaction preparation timely. It does not establish an increase in environmental claims or remove ordinary diligence from an investment decision.
+[USTR's February 2026 fact sheet](https://ustr.gov/about/policy-offices/press-office/fact-sheets/2026/february/fact-sheet-us-taiwan-agreement-reciprocal-trade) describes the two sides' intention to facilitate cross-border investment and possible US support for private investment financing in Taiwan, subject to applicable law.
 
